{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14114370","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14114370","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1411437001:1":{"text":"你闹够了没有，到处乱跑，到处都是炸弹！","source_cn":"你闹够了没有，到处乱跑，到处都是炸弹！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x710AC409AB49E0C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1411437002:1":{"text":"你知道在地下这么随便爆炸有多危险吗？","source_cn":"你知道在地下这么随便爆炸有多危险吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB7CBA070AE025E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1411437003:1":{"text":"那又怎么样！我们恶魔就是这么邪恶！","source_cn":"那又怎么样！我们恶魔就是这么邪恶！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0582899EDB149E4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1411437004:1":{"text":"我就要炸塌一切，让你们这些看不起我的人好好瞧瞧！","source_cn":"我就要炸塌一切，让你们这些看不起我的人好好瞧瞧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6C26F3E721D1C26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1411437005:1":{"text":"……的确，这就是库露丝塔当年癫狂的本性，看起来我也不需要手下留情了。","source_cn":"……的确，这就是库露丝塔当年癫狂的本性，看起来我也不需...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18621759DF22D73D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_stat